WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000
PHP is executed by a configured server before HTML reaches the browser.

2
00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:08.000
A PHP template can insert a value into an HTML page.

3
00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:12.000
Escape untrusted text when inserting it into HTML.

4
00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:16.000
Exercise: compare the template with its rendered HTML.
